<title>JAPAN: Bank of Kansai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Kansai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    21.11		vs	   27.03</p>
<p> Current	    644    million	  vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Net		  446    million	  vs	  450    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.12 yen	  vs	    4.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    108 million	  vs	 108 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.00 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Kansai Ltd is a regional bank operating in Osaka prefecture.</p>
</text>
